templates.body:
Turn these session notes into a SOAP note. Keep the client's own words in the Subjective section in quotes where I gave them. Do not add diagnoses, risk statements or interventions I did not write. Mark anything unclear with [confirm].

Client reference: {{client_ref}}
Session date: {{session_date}}
Modality: {{modality}}

Notes:
{{notes}}

Write an intake summary from the notes below: presenting concern, relevant history, current supports, risk factors I noted (only those), the client's stated goals, and an initial plan. Neutral clinical language, no speculation.

Client reference: {{client_ref}}
Date: {{intake_date}}

Notes:
{{notes}}

Propose a plan for the next session with {{client_ref}} based on the last summary: two goals for the session, a short agenda, two or three interventions consistent with {{modality}}, and one thing to check in on. Keep it to one page and present it as options for me, not instructions.

Last session summary:
{{last_summary}}

Draft a progress note for {{client_ref}} dated {{session_date}}: progress against each treatment goal listed, any change in functioning I described, interventions used, homework, and plan for next time. Only use what is in my notes.

Treatment goals:
{{goals}}

Session notes:
{{notes}}
